be the pilot of a great robot called \"Zeorymer of the Heavens\". The truth of this is hammered in when Masato sees his `parents` accept payment for raising him. The Last Guardian is preparing for the resurrection of \"Hau Dragon\", an organization bent on world conquest. 15 years ago, Hau Dragon built 8 great robots. Each of the mecha represents a force of nature. However, before any of the robots could be used, their creater Kihara Masaki destroyed the robots except for the leader: Zeorymer. He took Zeorymer and an embryo to the government. The embryo became the boy Masato. Now, Hau Dragon has rebuilt the other 7 mecha and wants the 8th. It will be up to Masato and Himuro to pilot Zeorymer and fight against the Hau Dragon, but neither Masato or Himuro are all that they seem.\n\n(Source: AniDB)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Robot","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reincarnation","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dissociative Identities","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Robots","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Clone","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Hades Project Zeorymer","english":"Hades Project Zeorymer","native":"冥王計画ゼオライマー","romaji":"Project Zeorymer","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"冥王计划志雷马"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Zeorymer"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"cn|冥王计划杰欧莱马"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"jp|プロジェクトゼオライマー"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}